   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Baseline triage accuracy is not invariant across runs: 8.33pp spread.",
   "originalText": "Baseline triage accuracy is not invariant across runs: 8.33pp spread.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "n8_900519",
   "x": 1460,
   "y": 2038,
   "width": 1188.0,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 900519,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900519,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Verdict: accuracy and hallucination are both reported as within noise under the pre-registered rule, because\nthe deltas are smaller than the 2.08pp run-to-run spread, even though the permutation test makes chance an\nunlikely explanation. Cost is the only regression that clears the bar.",
   "originalText": "Verdict: accuracy and hallucination are both reported as within noise under the pre-registered rule, because\nthe deltas are smaller than the 2.08pp run-to-run spread, even though the permutation test makes chance an\nunlikely explanation. Cost is the only regression that clears the bar.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "n8_900520",
   "x": 1460,
   "y": 2128,
   "width": 1221.0,
   "height": 50.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 900520,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900520,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Against target: lever 2's mean hallucination of 1.88% is under the 2% target while the baseline's 2.87% is not,\nbut the difference between the arms remains within noise.",
   "originalText": "Against target: lever 2's mean hallucination of 1.88% is under the 2% target while the baseline's 2.87% is not,\nbut the difference between the arms remains within noise.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
